---
import {showcaseMedia} from '../lib/showcase.mjs';
const {locale}=Astro.props;const ko=locale==='ko';
---
<section id="joint-geometry" class="joint-viewer" data-joint-viewer data-locale={locale} data-joint-root={showcaseMedia('reality-joint-geometry')} aria-labelledby={`joint-title-${locale}`}>
  <h2 id={`joint-title-${locale}`}>{ko?'RGB·깊이·카메라를 함께 복원하기':'Reconstruct RGB, depth and cameras together'}</h2>
  <p>{ko?'DA3·Aether와 기존 NuRec 장면을 바꿔 보세요. 카메라·시간을 선택하고 RGB 픽셀의 깊이와 3D 위치를 확인할 수 있습니다.':'Switch between DA3, Aether and NuRec. Choose a camera and time, then inspect an RGB pixel’s depth and 3D position.'}</p>
  <div class="joint-controls">
    <label>{ko?'출력 비교':'Compare outputs'} <select data-joint-model disabled><option value="calibrated">{ko?'DA3-BASE · RGB 카메라 보조 입력':'DA3-BASE · RGB/SfM camera priors'}</option><option value="surround">{ko?'DA3-BASE · 주변 RGB 6개':'DA3-BASE · 6 RGB cameras'}</option><option value="da3">{ko?'DA3-BASE · 전방 RGB':'DA3-BASE · front RGB'}</option><option value="aether">{ko?'AetherV1 · 전방 RGB':'AetherV1 · front RGB'}</option><option value="nurec">{ko?'NuRec · 기존 정적 3DGS':'NuRec · existing static 3DGS'}</option></select></label>
    <label><span>{ko?'RGB 카메라':'RGB camera'}</span><select data-joint-camera><option value="1">{ko?'앞':'Front'}</option><option value="0">{ko?'뒤':'Back'}</option><option value="2">{ko?'왼쪽 앞':'Front left'}</option><option value="3">{ko?'오른쪽 앞':'Front right'}</option><option value="4">{ko?'왼쪽':'Left'}</option><option value="5">{ko?'오른쪽':'Right'}</option></select></label>
    <div class="joint-presets">{['input','chase','side','overhead'].map((v,i)=><button data-joint-preset={v} disabled type="button">{(ko?['입력 카메라','추적','옆','위']:['Input camera','Chase','Side','Overhead'])[i]}</button>)}</div>
  </div>
  <div class="joint-layout">
    <div class="joint-observations">
      <figure><figcaption>{ko?'관측 RGB':'Observed RGB'}</figcaption><img data-joint-rgb src={showcaseMedia('reality-joint-geometry/da3/08.jpg')} width="756" height="504" alt={ko?'실제 도로 카메라 입력':'Actual road camera input'} loading="lazy" /></figure>
      <figure><figcaption>{ko?'예측한 Z-depth · 밝음: 가까움 / 파랑: 멂':'Predicted Z-depth · bright: near / blue: far'}</figcaption><canvas data-joint-depth width="252" height="168" role="img" aria-label={ko?'모델이 예측한 깊이, 회색은 표시에서 제외한 픽셀':'Model-predicted depth; gray pixels are display-filtered'}></canvas></figure>
    </div>
    <div class="joint-stage" data-joint-stage><div class="joint-cover" data-joint-cover><button data-joint-load type="button">{ko?'RGB·3D 비교 열기':'Open RGB / 3D comparison'}</button></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="joint-timeline"><button data-joint-play disabled type="button">{ko?'재생':'Play'}</button><label class="visually-hidden" for={`joint-frame-${locale}`}>{ko?'RGB 프레임':'RGB frame'}</label><input id={`joint-frame-${locale}`} data-joint-frame type="range" min="0" max="16" value="8" disabled /><output data-joint-time>2.4 s · 9/17</output></div>
  <p data-joint-status role="status">{ko?'마우스로 회전 · 휠/두 손가락으로 확대 · 모바일에서는 아래 3D 화면을 드래그하세요.':'Drag to orbit · scroll/pinch to zoom · on mobile, drag the lower 3D viewport.'}</p>
  <p data-joint-values class="joint-values">{ko?'RGB 픽셀을 눌러 깊이와 3D 좌표를 확인하세요.':'Click an RGB pixel to inspect its depth and 3D coordinate.'}</p>
  <p class="joint-caption">{ko?'DA3·Aether는 프레임별 RGB-D 메시, NuRec은 정적 Gaussian 장면입니다. 좌표는 상대 단위이며 관측하지 못한 면은 비어 있습니다.':'DA3 and Aether show frame-local RGB-D meshes; NuRec shows a static Gaussian scene. Coordinates are relative and unseen surfaces remain incomplete.'}</p>
  <p class="joint-caption">PandaSet: Scale AI / Hesai · <a href="https://github.com/Sage-PhysicalAI/Aether">Aether</a> · <a href="https://github.com/ByteDance-Seed/Depth-Anything-3">Depth Anything 3</a> · <a href="https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/volvo-s90-recharge-free-9462b07c10244fd4a28d86846dc9e3a9">Volvo S90: lazercar, CC BY 4.0</a> · <a href={showcaseMedia('reality-joint-geometry/ATTRIBUTION.txt')}>{ko?'전체 출처와 조건':'All sources and terms'}</a></p>
</section>
<script>
for(const root of document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-joint-viewer]')){
  let dispose:(()=>void)|undefined;
  const load=root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-joint-load]')!;
  load.addEventListener('click',async()=>{load.disabled=true;try{const {mountJointViewer}=await import('../../../labs/nurec-rgb-reality/unified/viewer.js');dispose=await mountJointViewer(root);root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-joint-cover]')!.hidden=true;}catch(error){load.disabled=false;root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-joint-status]')!.textContent=root.dataset.locale==='ko'?'3D 출력을 열지 못했습니다. 아래 비교 영상도 확인할 수 있습니다.':'Could not open the 3D outputs. A comparison recording is available below.';console.error(error);}});
  window.addEventListener('pagehide',()=>dispose?.(),{once:true});
}
</script>
<style>
.joint-viewer{margin-block:3rem}.joint-viewer p{line-height:1.7}.joint-controls,.joint-presets,.joint-timeline{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.65rem;flex-wrap:wrap}.joint-controls{justify-content:space-between;padding:1rem 0}.joint-controls label[hidden]{display:none}.joint-controls label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.75rem;flex-wrap:wrap}.joint-viewer button,.joint-viewer select{font:inherit;font-size:.85rem;border:1px solid var(--line,#c9cdd0);color:var(--text,#202428);background:var(--surface,#f6f8fa);padding:.6rem .8rem;border-radius:3px;cursor:pointer}.joint-viewer button:disabled,.joint-viewer select:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:wait}.joint-viewer button[aria-pressed="true"]{border-color:#76b900;box-shadow:inset 0 -2px #76b900}.joint-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(220px,1fr) minmax(0,2fr);border:1px solid var(--line,#c9cdd0);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;background:#dce1e5}.joint-observations{display:grid;grid-template-rows:1fr 1fr;background:var(--surface,#f6f8fa)}.joint-observations figure{margin:0;position:relative;min-width:0}.joint-observations img,.joint-observations canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;cursor:crosshair}.joint-observations figcaption{font-size:.7rem;line-height:1.4;padding:.35rem .5rem;color:var(--text,#202428);background:var(--surface,#f6f8fa)}.joint-stage{position:relative;min-width:0;min-height:320px;touch-action:none}.joint-stage :global(canvas){display:block;width:100%;height:100%;position:absolute;inset:0;touch-action:none}.joint-cover{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:1rem;flex-direction:column;padding:1rem;text-align:center;z-index:2;color:#38434a}.joint-cover[hidden]{display:none}.joint-cover button{background:#76b900;color:#12190a;border-color:#76b900;font-weight:600;font-size:1rem}.joint-cover span{font-size:.8rem}.joint-timeline{padding:.9rem 0}.joint-timeline input{flex:1;min-width:120px;accent-color:#76b900}.joint-timeline output{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:.85rem}.joint-values{font-family:var(--font-mono,monospace);font-size:.8rem;padding:.8rem 1rem;border-left:3px solid #76b900;background:var(--surface,#f6f8fa);overflow-wrap:anywhere}.joint-caption{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted,#59636b)}@media(max-width:650px){.joint-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.joint-observations{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;grid-template-rows:auto}.joint-observations figcaption{font-size:.63rem;min-height:3rem}.joint-stage{height:340px}.joint-controls select{max-width:100%}.joint-presets{gap:.35rem}.joint-presets button{font-size:.75rem;padding:.5rem}.joint-timeline output{font-size:.75rem}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.joint-viewer{scroll-behavior:auto}}
</style>
